{"id":"00522","root":"uni00522_1","name":{"ja":"リリス","en":"Lilith the First"},"title":{"ja":"【クラシックメイドウィッチ】","en":"【Classic Maid Witch】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【クラシックメイドウィッチ】 リリス","en":"【Classic Maid Witch】 Lilith the First"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2021-10-31","limited":false,"characterId":20,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の住人なら誰もが恐れ、３００キロは避けて通るといわれる伝説の大魔女リリス。彼女はその孫娘である。その寿命は数万年に及ぶという高位魔族で、通称“黒蛇の魔女”。祖母の名を継いで二代目リリスとなった彼女は、武者修行のため人間界に降り立った。未熟ゆえ１人ではオークの群れにも逃げ惑うレベルだが、才能は魔界随一で、秘めたる野望は誰にも負けない天然な性格。祖母の代から仕えている使い魔（＝従者）、メスの白い犬ベリリクが彼女を護衛し、普段の生活をサポートしている。その正体は神殺しで知られる古代龍（エンシェント・ドラゴン）だが、リリスはちょっと長生きで人に化けれるただの白い犬だと信じて疑っていない。","en":"She is the legendary Grand Witch Lilith, feared by every resident of the Demon Realm, who keep a 300-kilometre distance. She is that witch's granddaughter. As a high-ranking demon-folk with a lifespan of tens of thousands of years, she's known as the \"Black Serpent Witch.\" Inheriting her grandmother's name, she became the second-generation Lilith and descended to the Human Realm for warrior training. Because she's still inexperienced, she would flee from a pack of orcs on her own, but her talent is unrivaled in the Demon Realm and her hidden ambition rivals no one's—she's a natural-born dreamer. She is served by a familiar spirit—a white female dog named Berylic—who guards her and assists with daily life. Though Berylic is actually an ancient dragon famed for slaying gods, Lilith firmly believes she's just a long-lived white dog that can shape-shift."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"中家志穂","forms":[{"id":"uni00522_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1518,3036],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[117,234],"def":[159,318],"spd":[80,80],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","1260004"]},{"id":"uni00522_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2436,4872],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[159,318],"def":[243,486],"spd":[80,80],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","126